{"sha": "c7f86f20088ae003cd5e1819639ebcaa5ce75806e0796f40b6e2ac168b376a93", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:energy-conservation} 章 --- 能量：形式与守恒}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:1}", "$E_k = \\tfrac12 \\times 1200 \\times 25^2 = \\qty{3.75e5}{J}$。当", "速率为 \\qty{36.1}{m/s} 时：$\\tfrac12 \\times 1200 \\times 36.1^2 \\approx", "\\qty{7.8e5}{J}$ --- 速率提高 $44\\%$，动能为原来的 $(130/90)^2 \\approx 2.1$", "倍：平方关系在此起作用。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:2}", "$\\Delta h = \\qty{450}{m}$：", "$E_p = 72 \\times 9.81 \\times 450 \\approx \\qty{3.2e5}{J}", "= \\num{3.2e5}/\\num{3.6e6} \\approx \\qty{0.088}{kW.h}$，约 ", "$0.022$ 欧元。攀登一天，电费仅两欧分。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:3}", "$\\qty{1}{kW.h} = \\qty{3.6e6}{J}$;", "$\\qty{12}{W.h} = 12 \\times \\qty{3600}{J} \\approx \\qty{43}{kJ}$;", "$\\qty{45}{MJ} = 45/3.6 = \\qty{12.5}{kW.h}$;", "$\\qty{10}{MJ} = 10/3.6 \\approx \\qty{2.8}{kW.h}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:4}", "$E = 2200 \\times 150 = \\qty{3.3e5}{J}", "= \\num{3.3e5}/\\num{3.6e6} \\approx \\qty{0.092}{kW.h}$。人体：", "$P = \\num{1.0e7}/\\num{86400} \\approx \\qty{116}{W}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:5}", "发电机：化学能（骑车人的食物）$\\to$ 动能（车轮）$\\to$", "电能（发电机）$\\to$ 辐射能 $+$ 热能（灯）；热量", "散失于肌肉、轮胎接触处、发电机和灯。燃气加热器：化学能（燃气）", "$\\to$ 热能（水），热量随烟气排出。太阳能板：辐射能", "（太阳）$\\to$ 电能（太阳能板）$\\to$ 化学能（电池），热量", "散失于太阳能板和充电器。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:6}", "消耗的能量为 $2.0 \\times 45 = \\qty{90}{MJ}$；$\\eta = 27/90 = 0.30$。", "热量：$90 - 27 = \\qty{63}{MJ}$，经", "废气和散热器排入周围空气。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:7}", "$E_k = E_p = 70 \\times 9.81 \\times 20 \\approx \\qty{1.37e4}{J}$;", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 13734/70} = \\sqrt{392} \\approx \\qty{19.8}{m/s}", "\\approx \\qty{71}{km/h}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:8}", "$41562 - 41236 = \\qty{326}{kW.h}$；日均 $326/30 \\approx", "\\qty{10.9}{kW.h}$。电费：$326 \\times 0.26 + 12 = 96.76$ 欧元。", "平均功率：$\\qty{326}{kW.h}/\\qty{720}{h} \\approx \\qty{453}{W}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:9}", "\\emph{1.} 白炽灯：$0.05 \\times 60 = \\qty{3.0}{W}$；发光二极管：", "$\\eta = 3/9 \\approx 0.33$.", "\\emph{2.} 全年（$\\qty{1460}{h}$）：灯泡 ", "$60 \\times 1460 = \\qty{87.6}{kW.h}$，发光二极管 $\\qty{13.1}{kW.h}$；", "每个灯泡每年节省 $\\qty{74.5}{kW.h} \\approx 19$ 欧元。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:10}", "\\emph{1.} $P = \\num{1.5e5} \\times 9.81 \\times 40 \\approx", "\\qty{5.9e7}{W} = \\qty{59}{MW}$.", "\\emph{2.} $0.90 \\times 59 \\approx \\qty{53}{MW}$;", "$\\num{5.3e7}/525 \\approx \\num{1.0e5}$ 户家庭。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:11}", "$v = \\sqrt{2 \\times 9.81 \\times 0.050} \\approx \\qty{0.99}{m/s}$", "（质量抵消：$\\tfrac12 m v^2 = mgh$）。初始", "势能 $E_p = 0.20 \\times 9.81 \\times 0.050 \\approx \\qty{0.098}{J}$ 最终转化为", "空气和支点中的热能：单摆不是", "孤立系统，总能量 --- 摆动加热量 --- 恰好", "守恒。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:12}", "\\emph{1.} $\\eta = 0.38 \\times 0.94 \\times 0.85 \\approx 0.304$;", "消耗的能量为 $12/0.304 \\approx \\qty{39.5}{W.h}", "= 39.5 \\times 3600 \\approx \\qty{142}{kJ}$.", "\\emph{2.} 每次充电约需煤 $\\num{1.42e5}/\\num{2.5e7} \\approx \\qty{5.7}{g}$", "，每年约 $\\times 365 \\approx \\qty{2.1}{kg}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:13}", "\\emph{1.} $\\num{5e9}/\\num{3.6e6} \\approx \\qty{1400}{kW.h}$;", "$1400/12.6 \\approx 110$ 天。", "\\emph{2.} $P = \\num{5e9}/\\num{1e-4} = \\qty{5e13}{W} = \\qty{50}{TW}$", "--- 相当于人类平均电功率的十七倍，", "持续 \\qty{100}{\\micro s}，地点不可预测。闪电功率很大，", "但能量很少，释放得过快而无用：没有", "任何转换器能接受这样的尖峰。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:14}", "\\emph{1.} $E_k = \\tfrac12 \\times 1300 \\times 30.6^2 \\approx", "\\qty{6.1e5}{J}$，转化为刹车盘和刹车片中的", "热能（再传给空气）。", "\\emph{2.} 每次制动约 $0.60 \\times \\qty{6.1e5}{J} \\approx \\qty{3.7e5}{J}$，", "每千瓦时约 $\\num{3.6e6}/\\num{3.7e5} \\approx 10$ 次制动。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:energy-conservation:15}", "$E_p = 85 \\times 9.81 \\times 1200 \\approx \\qty{1.0}{MJ}$；食物：", "$1.0/0.25 = \\qty{4.0}{MJ}$，即 $4.0/1.5 \\approx 2.7$ 碗", "麦片 --- 或 $4.0/45 \\approx \\qty{0.09}{kg}$ 汽油。整整一个", "上午的踏实劳动，一咖啡杯的燃料即可装下：化学能", "的密集程度荒谬得惊人。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}